# Per-user, non-secret configuration, loaded by .envrc.user.template's
# `dotenv_if_exists .env.local`. Copy to .env.local and uncomment what you
# need; unlike .envrc.secrets and .envrc.user it is not created for you.
#
# Parsed by `direnv dotenv` (KEY=value), NOT sourced as shell: no command
# substitution, no conditionals. Shell logic belongs in .envrc.user; secrets
# belong behind sops in .envrc.secrets.

# The team kata server, for .envrc.kata: the literal tailnet IP
# (100.64.0.0/10), not a name. The token, KATA_TEAM_TOKEN, is a secret and
# comes from the secrets layer.
# KATA_TEAM_SERVER=http://100.x.y.z:7777
